Components Required

• ESP32 DevKit V1 – 1
• DS1307 Real-Time Clock (RTC) Module – 1
• SSD1306 OLED Display (128×64, I2C) – 1
• SG90 Micro Servo Motor – 1
• Push Button Switch – 1
• Active Buzzer – 1
• Red LED – 1
• Green LED – 1
• 220 Ω Resistors – 2
• Jumper Wires – As Required
• Breadboard – 1
• USB Cable (for ESP32 Programming) – 1